Schema migrations for placement-engine (Alembic, async template).

The app never creates or alters tables; it refuses to start unless the database
is at the head revision. From placement-engine/:

    .\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic upgrade head        # apply migrations
    .\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic check               # models vs. database drift
    .\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The target database is the app's DATABASE_URL (environment or .env). Review every
autogenerated migration before committing it.
